<header><p class="st-kicker">republic · South Asia</p><h1 class="st-title">Sri Lanka</h1><p class="st-meta">1972 CE – present · capital Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The island republic of the Indian Ocean, which emerged from a 26-year civil war in 2009.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The constitution of 1972 ended the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/dominion-of-ceylon">Dominion of Ceylon</a> and renamed the country Sri Lanka, giving <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/buddhism">Buddhism</a> a foremost place. In 1978 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/j-r-jayewardene">J. R. Jayewardene</a> introduced an executive presidency, and the administrative capital moved to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sri-jayawardenepura-kotte">Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte</a>, near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/colombo">Colombo</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/j-r-jayewardene">Jayewardene</a>'s government opened the economy, but anti-Tamil riots in 1983 began a civil war with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/liberation-tigers-of-tamil-eelam">Liberation Tigers of Tamil Eelam</a> seeking a Tamil state in the north and east. Indian peacekeepers intervened from 1987 to 1990, and a second <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/janatha-vimukthi-peramuna">JVP</a> insurrection was crushed. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tea">Tea</a>, garments and tourism drove the economy. The Sri Lankan army defeated the Tigers in 2009 at great civilian cost.</p><h2>To the present</h2><p>The republic continues. A debt crisis in 2022 led to mass protests and the resignation of President <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gotabaya-rajapaksa">Gotabaya Rajapaksa</a>, and in 2024 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anura-kumara-dissanayake">Anura Kumara Dissanayake</a> of the left-wing <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/national-peoples-power">NPP</a> alliance was elected president.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/sri-lanka.jpg" alt="Sri Lanka" width="320" height="160"><figcaption>Image: Original: Sri Lanka Vectorization: Zscout370, Mike Rohsopht · Public domain · <a href="https:/